-- MASTER FILE / COMPLETE RECONSTRUCTION
-- Base: attached JJS_FULL_Merged_Gojo_Visuals_VerifiedHit.lua (132214 bytes).
-- Reconstructed additions: Yuji Quick, Gojo opening M1s + Advanced, Mahito,
-- Megumi, compact refreshed UI, search, settings arrows and shared side dashes.
-- Fixed scripted dash: A/D + Q held 300 ms, then an 80-degree camera flick
-- eased over 120 ms; estimated side-dash cooldown is 2 seconds.
-- No adjustable dash-hold, flick-angle or flick-delay controls.
-- IMPORTANT: no Luau compiler or Roblox gameplay test was performed here.
-- JJSVerifiedCombat is a CUSTOM integration and is NOT configured by this file.
-- Without it, V2/V3 and Yuji Quick remain blocked instead of fabricating hits.
-- Optional CUSTOM JJSActionFeedback.isReady(character, keyName, targetModel)
-- can gate the added modules' skill inputs. It is not a discovered game API.
-- Without that adapter, non-verified moves retain uncalibrated timing fallback.
-- Existing legacy combos also retain uncalibrated attack timings.
-- A reported self-hit must identify the relevant originating attack in the adapter.
-- No perfect Black Flash, true combo, knockback or damage guarantee is made.
-- FULL MERGED CLIENT: organized UI + verified V2/V3 + Visuals + Gojo.
-- Not Luau-compiled or live-tested. Gojo delays and dash timers are estimates.
-- AUTO BLACKFLASH + DASH COOLDOWNS
-- Press 3: wait 325 ms, then send selected follow-up.
-- Dash cooldowns are manual timers: Dash 6s, Side Dash 2s.
-- Input simulation is environment-dependent. Not live-tested.
local Players=game:GetService("Players")
local RS=game:GetService("RunService")
local UIS=game:GetService("UserInputService")
local LP=Players.LocalPlayer
assert(LP,"Client required")
local PG=LP:WaitForChild("PlayerGui")
local old=PG:FindFirstChild("AutoBlackflash")
if old then old:Destroy() end
